  "job_B17.1_20251003_114356": {
    "chunk_text": "& Grimbald Her com \u00e6\u00f0elwald hider ofer s\u00e6 mid \u00fe\u00e6m flotan \u00fee he mid w\u00e6s on East Sexe. Her aspon \u00e6\u00f0elwald \u00feone here on East Englum to unfri\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hie hergodon ofer Mercnaland o\u00f0 hie \u00dea for Eadweard cyning \u00e6fter, swa he ra\u00f0ost mehte his fird gegadrian, & oferhergade eall hira land \u00dea he \u00f0a eft \u00feonan utfaran wolde, \u00fea het he beodan ofer ealle \u00fea fird \u00fe\u00e6t hie foron ealle ut \u00e6tsomne. \u00dea \u00e6ts\u00e6ton \u00f0a Centiscan \u00fe\u00e6r be\u00e6ftan ofer his bebod, & seofon \u00e6rendracan he him h\u00e6fde to asend. \u00dea befor se here hie \u00f0\u00e6r, & hie \u00f0\u00e6r gefuhton, & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Sigulf ealdormon ofsl\u00e6gen, & Sigelm & on \u00f0ara Deniscena healfe wear\u00f0 ofsl\u00e6gen Eohric hira cyng, & \u00e6\u00f0elwald \u00e6\u00f0eling \u00f0e hine to \u00fe\u00e6m & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s on gehw\u00e6\u00f0re hond micel w\u00e6l gesl\u00e6gen, & \u00feara Deniscena \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 ma ofsl\u00e6gen, & Ealhswi\u00f0 gefor \u00fey ilcan geare. Her on \u00feys geare gefor \u00e6lfred, w\u00e6s \u00e6t Ba\u00f0um gerefa. & on \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan gere mon f\u00e6stnode \u00feone fri\u00f0 \u00e6t Yttinga forda, swa swa Eadweard cyng ger\u00e6dde, Her gefor Denulf, se w\u00e6s on Winteceastre biscop; Her feng Fri\u00f0estan to biscopdome on Winteceastre, & Asser biscop gefor \u00e6fter \u00f0\u00e6m, se w\u00e6s \u00e6t & \u00fey ilcan gere sende Eadwe",
